WEBVTT

00:04:28.765 --> 00:04:30.994
we could begin seeing
products on the market

00:04:31.018 --> 00:04:34.884
that work with our body's defense system
to help us regenerate,

00:04:34.908 --> 00:04:38.963
and maybe one day be able
to keep pace with a salamander.

00:04:39.876 --> 00:04:41.027
Thank you.

00:04:41.051 --> 00:04:44.690
(Applause)